WEBVTT

00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:07.883
In this video, you will vote for your favorite homes in a neighborhood contest, and see how voting works, so you know your vote counts.

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:08.837
We start on the map.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.483
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:16.836
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.537 --> 00:00:19.517
Then tap Allow.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:26.529
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:29.312
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:29.312 --> 00:00:33.875
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:34.576
Tap it.

00:00:36.171 --> 00:00:38.134
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:43.824
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:43.824 --> 00:00:46.251
This opens on your own page, Mine.

00:00:46.251 --> 00:00:49.606
To see every contest that is open today, tap Live now.

00:00:51.286 --> 00:00:54.182
Under Live now, find the contest, and tap Vote.

00:00:55.975 --> 00:00:58.870
The first time, the site asks you to sign in.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:03.093
That keeps it fair, with one vote per person in each category.

00:01:03.093 --> 00:01:05.872
Want to see the homes in person before you decide?

00:01:05.872 --> 00:01:07.505
Tap Visit the homes.

00:01:07.505 --> 00:01:13.383
It splits the homes into routes of nine stops or fewer, and sends each one to your maps app.

00:01:13.383 --> 00:01:17.999
Each route starts where the last one ended, and you can tick off each home as you go.

00:01:18.873 --> 00:01:20.097
Now the ballot.

00:01:20.097 --> 00:01:24.443
Every home is in every category, and you pick one favorite in each.

00:01:24.443 --> 00:01:27.208
Start with the first category, Best Traditional.

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:29.956
Look through the homes, and tap Vote on your favorite.

00:01:31.794 --> 00:01:34.572
The next category opens by itself.

00:01:34.572 --> 00:01:38.710
In Most Creative, tap Vote on the home you think is the most inventive.

00:01:40.561 --> 00:01:42.279
And last, Best Animated.

00:01:42.279 --> 00:01:43.318
Tap your favorite.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:46.858
Thanks for voting!

00:01:46.858 --> 00:01:51.248
Your votes are saved, and you can change any of them until voting closes.

00:01:51.248 --> 00:01:53.337
You cannot vote for your own home.

00:01:53.337 --> 00:01:59.016
And tap Share this contest, to send it to a neighbor, because more votes make the contest more fun.

00:02:00.644 --> 00:02:02.475
Next up: Judge a contest.
